WEBVTT

00:11:59.696 --> 00:12:03.862
F dak el-weqt, hadak weš dar.

00:12:03.862 --> 00:12:09.624
W ḍerwek, rahi ṣarya f kul muḍeɛ.

00:12:09.624 --> 00:12:11.533
Ma 'emmentuniš?

00:12:11.533 --> 00:12:15.192
Seqsitu rwaḥtikum

00:12:15.192 --> 00:12:19.632
ɛlaš w kifeš šḥal men diktaturiya tzeɛzɛet

00:12:19.632 --> 00:12:22.983
f had el-30 ɛam el-twala?

00:12:22.983 --> 00:12:28.050
Diktaturiyat f Čikoslovakya, el-'alman el-šerq,

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.265
'Estonya, Latvya, Litwanya,